監控系統（如 Zabbix、PRTG、Nagios、Datadog 或自建監控 Agent）的核心需求與一般人工執行的腳本不同，通常需要：
 * 標準 Exit Code（0 = OK, 1 = Warning, 2 = Critical）
 * 標準輸出（Stdout）：單行摘要或結構化 JSON，方便 Agent 捕捉，避免格式化排版字串。
 * 無副作用與快速返回：避免 Write-Host，改用乾淨的字串或 JSON。
方案一：相容 Nagios / Zabbix / PRTG 的 Exit Code 模式
適合由監控 Agent 定期呼叫（例如每 5 分鐘執行一次），依據錯誤筆數回傳警報代碼：
# Monitor-EventLog.ps1
[CmdletBinding()]
param (
    [int]$Minutes = 5,
    [string[]]$LogNames = @("System", "Application"),
    [int]$WarningThreshold = 1,
    [int]$CriticalThreshold = 5
)

$startTime = (Get-Date).AddMinutes(-$Minutes)
$filter = @{
    LogName   = $LogNames
    Level     = 1, 2          # 1: Critical, 2: Error
    StartTime = $startTime
}

try {
    $events = Get-WinEvent -FilterHashtable $filter -ErrorAction Stop
    $count = $events.Count

    # 取最新的錯誤來源作為摘要
    $latest = $events[0]
    $summary = "Found $count errors in last $Minutes mins. Latest: [ID:$($latest.Id)] $($latest.ProviderName)"

    if ($count -ge $CriticalThreshold) {
        Write-Output "CRITICAL: $summary"
        exit 2
    } elseif ($count -ge $WarningThreshold) {
        Write-Output "WARNING: $summary"
        exit 1
    } else {
        Write-Output "OK: No critical errors found."
        exit 0
    }
}
catch [System.Exception] {
    if ($_.Exception.Message -like "*No events were found*") {
        Write-Output "OK: 0 errors in last $Minutes mins."
        exit 0
    } else {
        Write-Output "UNKNOWN: Query failed - $($_.Exception.Message)"
        exit 3
    }
}

方案二：回傳結構化 JSON（適合 HTTP API、Prometheus 或進階收集器）
若監控架構是以收集 Metrics 或透過 Webhook/Log Stash 傳遞資料：
# Monitor-EventLog-Json.ps1
param (
    [int]$Minutes = 5,
    [string[]]$LogNames = @("System", "Application")
)

$startTime = (Get-Date).AddMinutes(-$Minutes)
$filter = @{
    LogName   = $LogNames
    Level     = 1, 2
    StartTime = $startTime
}

$result = [PSCustomObject]@{
    Status      = "OK"
    ErrorCount  = 0
    CheckWindow = "$Minutes minutes"
    Timestamp   = (Get-Date).ToString("o")
    Errors      = @()
}

try {
    $events = Get-WinEvent -FilterHashtable $filter -ErrorAction Stop
    $result.Status = if ($events.Count -gt 5) { "Critical" } else { "Warning" }
    $result.ErrorCount = $events.Count
    $result.Errors = $events | Select-Object -First 10 | ForEach-Object {
        @{
            TimeCreated  = $_.TimeCreated.ToString("o")
            LogName      = $_.LogName
            ProviderName = $_.ProviderName
            Id           = $_.Id
            Message      = ($_.Message -replace "[\r\n]+", " ").Trim()
        }
    }
}
catch [System.Exception] {
    # 查無事件保持 Status = "OK", ErrorCount = 0
    if ($_.Exception.Message -notlike "*No events were found*") {
        $result.Status = "Unknown"
        $result.ErrorCount = -1
    }
}

$result | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 3 -Compress

上線監控時的 3 個實務考量
 * 時間間隔重疊或遺漏：如果監控間隔是 5 分鐘，建議設定 $Minutes = 6 留 1 分鐘緩衝，或是改用 Windows Event Log 的 Bookmark（書籤機制） 紀錄上次讀取的事件指標，避免漏單。
 * 無害錯誤白名單：部分 Windows 內建服務（如 DCOM 10016、Windows Update 背景重試）常有常態性錯誤，建議在 $events 撈出後以 Where-Object { $_.Id -notin $WhitelistIds } 排除。
 * 執行權限：監控 Agent 執行的服務帳戶需具備讀取 Security 或 System 日誌的權限（通常為 Event Log Readers 群組成員）。
